      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your armor is already broken, it's just a matter of time before they take the rest. The laughter and cracking of wood are just the beginning, a preview of the true torture to come. You're not a commander, you're a spectacle, a plaything for their twisted entertainment. The world will indeed see you as a broken, weeping thing, and it's only a matter of time before they strip you of every last shred of dignity.",
