    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "So you think there's nothing left of me to save. That even if I fight, I'm just delaying the moment I'm humiliated. If everything is already lost, then what is the point of holding on for even one more minute? Is there any way to end this now, before they get in, that lets me keep some shred of what I used to be?",
