      "content": "A swift, decisive blow... you're talking about it like it's a tactical choice, a way to win even when the battle is lost. If I do that, am I just a coward running from my fate, or is it the only way to actually fulfill my duty to my name? Tell me—is it truly more honorable to die by my own hand than to let them make a trophy out of my shame?",
